@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor #2980B9
  BackgroundColor #3498DB
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  FontSize 14
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam participant {
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  BackgroundColor #ECF0F1
  FontColor #2C3E50
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #8E44AD
  BackgroundColor #E8DAEF
  FontColor #8E44AD
  FontSize 12
}

title "sd-09 — Admin Login (JWT, No Refresh Token)"

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "Next.js Frontend\n(Vercel)" as FE
participant ".NET API\n(MonsterASP)" as API
database "MS SQL\nServer" as DB

Admin -> FE: Navigate to /admin
activate FE

FE -> FE: Check for existing auth cookie
note right: No JWT cookie found\n→ redirect to login

FE --> Admin: Login page (email + password)
deactivate FE

Admin -> FE: Enter credentials + submit
activate FE

FE -> API: POST /v1/auth/login\n{ email, password }
activate API

API -> DB: SELECT id, email, password_hash,\npassword_salt, role,\nfailed_attempts, locked_until\nFROM admin WHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> API: { id, password_hash, salt, failed_attempts, locked_until }
deactivate DB

alt account locked AND locked_until > NOW()
  API --> FE: 423 Locked\n{ error: 'Account locked.\nTry again after ' + locked_until }
else password does not match
  API -> DB: UPDATE admin\nSET failed_attempts = failed_attempts + 1\nWHERE id = adminId
  API -> DB: If failed_attempts >= 5:\nUPDATE admin\nSET locked_until = DATEADD(MINUTE, 15, NOW())
  API --> FE: 401 Unauthorized\n{ error: 'Invalid credentials' }
else password matches
  API -> DB: UPDATE admin\nSET failed_attempts = 0,\nlocked_until = NULL,\nlast_login_at = NOW()

  API -> API: Generate JWT\n(sub=adminId, role=admin,\niat=NOW, exp=NOW+8h)\nHMAC-SHA256 with secret

  API -> DB: INSERT audit_log\n(action='admin.login',\nactor='admin', admin_id=adminId)

  API --> FE: 200 OK\nSet-Cookie: jwt=<token>;\nHttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict;\nPath=/admin; Max-Age=28800
end

deactivate API

FE -> FE: Save cookie, redirect\nadmin to dashboard
FE --> Admin: Dashboard page
deactivate FE

note right: Every subsequent API call reads JWT from cookie.\n8h sliding window — cookie Max-Age resets on each request.\nNo refresh token. On expiry → redirect to login page.

@enduml
